      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "For Kofi and Ahmed, leaning too heavily into overt cultural patterns might make the fintech app feel less trustworthy or serious to a global audience. A more sophisticated approach is to use subtle color psychology—like warmer tones for Ahmed or bolder accents for Kofi—while maintaining a clean, modern UI structure. The core functionality needs to look robust and professional, so the cultural elements should be accents, not the entire design language.",
